# Without this, COPY apps/<app> ./apps/<app> in the Dockerfiles overwrites the
# node_modules symlink farm that `pnpm install` just built inside the image with the
# host's own (on Windows, pnpm junctions that do not survive the copy), and the build
# dies on an unresolvable workspace dependency. A fresh clone on the VPS has no
# node_modules, which is why this only bites when building from a working tree.
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts — every image regenerates these.
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never bake local state or secrets into an image; compose supplies env at runtime.
.env
data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

.git
.github
**/coverage
**/.vitest
